33,1,1,talk,May,,Right? It was almost too obvious. Or maybe it's a bluff?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have a strong feeling about one person. Sakura, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
